      "writtenOn": "2022-12-28T23:29:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that originally batch scan is detected by the platform based on the fact that app sets report delay.\n\nFor Apps using CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCHES_AUTO_BATCH, the platform should force it to use a large default value of reportDelay (\u003e\u003d10 min). Allowing it to be zero probably doesn\u0027t make sense in this case.",
      "parentUuid": "e022f721_d637bcca",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 104,
        "startChar": 54,
        "endLine": 104,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "22b5fe58a4bb819b7278d1d310e5123562ef5b40",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a20df057_fce143fd",
