      "writtenOn": "2022-12-29T00:48:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For auto batch, I\u0027m curious do we have to force the reportDelay \u003e\u003d 10min in ScanSettings.java explicitly or ScanManager.java silently?",
      "parentUuid": "a20df057_fce143fd",
      "range": {
