      "writtenOn": "2022-12-30T05:18:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My point is normally batch scan is derived/detected from reportDelay value.  This is fine. However, it probably doesn\u0027t make sense to allow the app to use the new CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCHES_AUTO_BATCH with reportDelay \u003d 0. So I would suggest to force reportDelay to a large value in case of CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCHES_AUTO_BATCH mode.",
      "parentUuid": "4de5d3a6_fa491a4e",
